{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_084_1000_047sub", "source_sha256": "a1fb76b43e17f17f3bd9655bf5f3193f1608158a1d462623ede3c6bddd7bf463", "ja": "あ、{$P$}！\nなーなー、ちょっと聞いてくれよ～！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n喂喂，听我说嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_084_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "6a875cfb24e5714df3315192f44cbeaefde096ffb7561f6dfb80d66936b616d8", "ja": "公演のあと家に帰ったらさ、なんか家族が\nオレのこと、メチャクチャほめてくれたんだけど……。", "zh": "演出结束回家后，家人居然把我夸得特别厉害……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_084_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e9580da517ea2c2b4bbe419d9a80d293fe69e098e924f227eb5b2ba1ef3f53a4", "ja": "そうなのか？　\n……でも褒められたのに、なんで不満そうなんだ？", "zh": "是这样吗？\n……不过明明被夸了，为什么看起来还是一副不满的样子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_084_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "0d50bf845ec20e6843f06a63e52592149fd74044c708d6763e5ad24f1b79c742", "ja": "だって家族だぜ？　急にカワイイとか、\n歌が上手いとか言われたら、照れるって～！", "zh": "因为是家人嘛？突然被说可爱啦、唱歌好听啦，当然会害羞啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_084_1004_p", "source_sha256": "6428b952acf8c6a6059b9b0e907c33c6008eff8a539489962b88b46b4b98840f", "ja": "はは、そうか。でも昴のステージは、本当に\n良かったと思うよ。胸を張っていいんじゃないかな。", "zh": "哈哈，是吗。不过，我觉得昴的舞台真的很棒。你完全可以为此感到自豪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_084_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "a1fcf4892bae31e45d5884379f2c3a958ff16f25ccfa5a6320c5dd54819f5aba", "ja": "{$P$}がそういうなら、\nまぁいいけど……あ、そうだ！　もうひとつ報告！", "zh": "{$P$}要是这么说，那就算了……啊，对了！还有一件事要报告！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_084_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "b6a9ed35f93038fbf09a4c60604d6ed318908bcc4674cfb63bab84c84bebbe83", "ja": "颯太兄ちゃん……一番下の兄ちゃんがさ、\n大学行っても野球続けるって言ってた！", "zh": "飒太哥哥……最小的哥哥他说，就算上了大学也要继续打棒球！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_084_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "3390d441d5efac508cfaaa5b2ff755ff316cbf42277a2ef4f95cd2a494e3a457", "ja": "オレのステージ見て、続けるって決めたって言ってた。\nなんかオレ、すっげーうれしくてさ……へへ♪", "zh": "他说看了我的舞台，决定要继续打棒球。\n我特别开心……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_084_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c5a1aa6bef1547ba25dcc8fd6bff7ff68dc2c7c5493f11000b726fe063bd6a63", "ja": "なるほど、昴のステージに背中を押されたって事か。\n応援、ちゃんと届いたみたいだな！", "zh": "原来如此，是昴的舞台给了她继续下去的勇气啊。你的支持，看来确实传达到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_084_1009_047sub", "source_sha256": "08412a0c3fc43303b3f0a7d47fe2aa9cad80912f75d4dff3840b2c51b8eee694", "ja": "うん！　へへっ♪", "zh": "嗯！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_084_1010_p", "source_sha256": "7f2092aafbfc4738de50e7d416427d89c0a5a211f2118be37bdf4ac23403b28f", "ja": "けど……俺が今さら言うのもなんだけど、\n昴もお兄さんの試合、見たかったんじゃないか？", "zh": "不过……虽然现在才由我来说这话有点奇怪，昴其实也想看哥哥的比赛吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_084_1011_047sub", "source_sha256": "6e698718944a769c2062bababc1a53c5f8f02998d7714b84e6d627eed5f5b0ba", "ja": "あ、それは大丈夫！　一番上の兄ちゃんが試合を\n映像で撮っててくれたから、バッチリ見られたんだ！", "zh": "啊，那个没关系！因为大哥帮我把比赛录下来了，所以我看得特别过瘾！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_084_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "136f0482c9378f6a38eba4dc410f44698cc2972ee24171e503215f55130419f7", "ja": "でもさ……うぅ……。", "zh": "可是……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_084_1013_p", "source_sha256": "ac9fc9bd6efd07d26f3824860af200a86a965041297d566449cb63b9dba1ec2b", "ja": "まだ何かあるのか？", "zh": "还有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_084_1014_047sub", "source_sha256": "1658cbd61b0f6464ad13206034680f4a50aac4fd97cc3f09750fd68df449bbc2", "ja": "家族みんなで撮った映像見てたらさ、そのうち\nどんどん、昔のヤツとか引っ張り出してきて……。", "zh": "全家人一起看拍下的录像时，后来就\n接连不断地翻出以前的录像来看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_084_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "85991ab83d0b2cc75d88eb85459d4f93a5f0ec9663d216d9f9a05e7dc918dc57", "ja": "最後は、オレが赤ちゃんのころのヤツとか\n見せてくるんだぜ？　すっげーハズかったよ～！", "zh": "最后还翻出了我小时候当婴儿的视频给大家看，你说尴不尴尬啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_084_1016_p", "source_sha256": "9bdd5113d2d82babfb31fd6cc526d21db7efa6642c303f102d71147887cd2c3a", "ja": "へえ……赤ちゃんの昴か。\nそれは、ちょっと見てみたいな。可愛いだろうし。", "zh": "哦……还是婴儿时期的昴啊。\n那我还真有点想看看。肯定很可爱吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_084_1017_047sub", "source_sha256": "ff580fdb5ba31884ea11f7c1853ac7b5391539d93c4759586770fc841fca6959", "ja": "ええっ！？　{$P$}にとか、\nハズいから絶対やだ～！！！", "zh": "诶！？要给{$P$}看什么的，太羞耻了，绝对不要～！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_084_1018_p", "source_sha256": "12bfb181e5ee042dc99175a865c8796894069a3bd76e89b787843735f3a90566", "ja": "あっ！　そんな、何も逃げなくても……。\nおーい、昴～？", "zh": "啊！等等，也不用什么都不说就逃走吧……\n喂——昴～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
